<https://decision-cli.dev/ns/result/VGR-128/step/4> <https://decision-cli.dev/ns#stdoutExcerpt> "decision-cli — orchestration system for Decision-Driven Design\n\nUsage: dec [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  init       Initialise the orchestration store from a ValueStream definition\n  status     Report the active value stream's bootstrap provenance\n  implement  Implement a feature end-to-end (FT-011 + FT-013)\n  preflight  Feature-coverage report sourced from the internal product-cli graph projection (FT-052 / TC-087). Reads `.product/graph/index.ttl`; does not re-parse markdown\n  health     Liveness check (FT-012). Runs outside an initialised working tree\n  doctor     Worker preflight audit (FT-016 / TC-047)\n  events     Inspect persisted events (FT-012; FT-005 replay, FT-004 SSE tail)\n  session    Session inspection commands (FT-012)\n  feedback   Feedback inspection commands (FT-029 / FT-033)\n  mcp        MCP server (FT-034 / ADR-029)\n  verify     Verification artifact management (FT-038 / ADR-028 / ADR-029)\n  migrate    Provenance migration tooling (FT-074 / ADR-042)\n  product    Absorbed product-cli surface (FT-105 / ADR-067)\n  query      QueryTemplate catalog inspection (FT-075 / ADR-043)\n  workers    Worker container lifecycle (FT-095 — slice 1: `run` only)\n  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nOptions:\n      --workdir <WORKDIR>  Override the working directory (defaults to CWD; ADR-012 walk-up not yet implemented)\n  -h, --help               Print help\n  -V, --version            Print version\n" <https://decision-cli.dev/ns/graph/verify-result> .
